#==============================================================================================
#
#   resize_handle - Painting::ResizeHandle: the chrome widget of a resizable box's resizer
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/ResizeHandle.cpp (lines 1-80) and ResizeHandle.h:
#       hit testing the resizer, its cursor, and the pointer events that start, continue and end
#       an ElementResizeAction.
